@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : launchesApplication()
activate System

note right of System: The system checks for an existing\nactive session in SharedPreferences.

alt Active Session Found
    System --> User : automatically redirects to Main Dashboard
else No Active Session
    System --> User : displays Login screen for credential entry
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
